train others. I’m also a strong communicator, which helps me collaborate effectively in team settings.\"", "category": 1}}, {"model": "pasApp.interview", "pk": 5, "fields": {"product": 2, "question": "Can you tell me about yourself?", "answer": "💡 Tip: Focus on your experience, skills, and career growth.\r\n\r\n✅ Sample Answer:\r\n\"I have [X years] of experience in [your industry] with a strong background in [mention key skills]. In my last role at [Company Name], I led a team of [number] and successfully [mention achievement]. I thrive in fast-paced environments and enjoy solving complex problems. I’m excited about this opportunity because it allows me to apply my expertise while continuing to grow professionally.\"", "category": 2}}, {"model": "pasApp.interview", "pk": 6, "fields": {"product": 2, "question": "What are your key strengths, and how have they contributed to your success?", "answer": "💡 Tip: Choose 2-3 strengths relevant to the role and back them up with examples.\r\n\r\n✅ Sample Answer:\r\n\"One of my key strengths is strategic thinking. In my previous role, I identified an inefficiency in our workflow and implemented a new process that increased productivity by 25%. Another strength is team leadership—I enjoy mentoring junior employees and have successfully helped several team members develop their skills and get promoted.\"", "category": 2}}, {"model": "pasApp.interview", "pk": 7, "fields": {"product": 2, "question": "Can you describe a time you had to handle a difficult situation at work?", "answer": "💡 Tip: Use the STAR method (Situation, Task, Action, Result).\r\n\r\n✅ Sample Answer:\r\n\"At my last job, a key client was unhappy with our service due to delays. As the project lead, I quickly assessed the issue, restructured the timeline, and communicated transparently with the client. I also worked closely with my team to streamline processes. As a result, we not only met the revised deadline but also strengthened our relationship with the client